{"seq":1,"slug":"rp-server-architecture-credential-store","title":"RP 服务端架构与凭证存储（challenge 生命周期与多域 RP ID 配置）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/webauthn-passkeys-passwordless-authentication-engineering/server-integration-compliance-ops/rp-server-architecture-credential-store","wordCount":2490,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"rp-服务端架构与凭证存储-challenge-生命周期与多域-rp-id-配置\">RP 服务端架构与凭证存储（challenge 生命周期与多域 RP ID 配置）</h1><p>一个跨境电商站点做 passkey 上线时，最先出事的往往不是密码学，而是<strong>状态</strong>：challenge 存在进程内存里导致多实例部署随机失败、凭证表把 <code>credentialId</code> 当主键却没存 <code>rpId</code>、主域与 <code>.co.uk</code> 站群共用一套代码却各写各的 RP ID。本文只谈服务端这一侧——challenge 从生成到一次性消费的生命周期、凭证记录（credential record）的落库 schema、RP ID 的作用域规则与多域配置，以及围绕这些状态的一致性防护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务端必须自持的秘密状态只有两处：<strong>challenge</strong>（每次仪式一个、一次性）与<strong>凭证记录</strong>（每个公钥一条、长期）。后文全部推导自 W3C Web Authentication Level 3（2026-08-25 成为正式推荐标准，来源：<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/webauthn-3/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/webauthn-3/</a>）的三条规范事实：<strong>RP ID 是全部安全边界的锚点</strong>（§4：凭证&quot;只能用在与注册时同一实体（由 RP ID 标识）的认证中&quot;）；<strong>challenge 必须服务端生成且一次消费</strong>（§13.4.3：&quot;Tolerating a mismatch will compromise the security of the protocol&quot;）；<strong>多域只能靠一个共同 RP ID + Related Origin Requests</strong>，不能靠多个 RP ID 拼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"challenge-的生命周期-生成-临时存储-一次性消费\">challenge 的生命周期：生成、临时存储、一次性消费</h2><p>规范 §13.4.3 Cryptographic Challenges 给出四条硬约束，逐条都能直接翻译成工程要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MUST 由 RP 在可信环境随机生成</strong>（&quot;in an environment they trust (e.g., on the server-side)&quot;）。</li>\n<li><strong>返回值 MUST 与生成值匹配</strong>——&quot;the returned challenge value in the client&#39;s response MUST match what was generated&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>SHOULD 临时存储而非依赖客户端行为</strong>——&quot;SHOULD store the challenge temporarily until the operation is complete&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>熵 SHOULD ≥ 16 字节</strong>——&quot;Challenges SHOULD therefore be at least 16 bytes long&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>熵下界可直接写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mtext> bits</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = 8n \\ \\text{bits}, \\ n \\ge 16 \\Rightarrow H \\ge 128</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bits</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span></span></span></span></span>，单次盲猜命中概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\le 2^{-128}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。实践上直接取 32 字节（256 bit）。</p>\n<p>有效期不是随意定的：规范要求 challenge &quot;SHOULD be valid for a duration similar to the upper limit of the recommended range and default for a WebAuthn ceremony timeout&quot;，而 §15.1 给出的范围是 <strong>300000–600000 毫秒（5–10 分钟），推荐默认 300000 毫秒</strong>。因此 TTL 应落在 5–10 分钟，且<strong>略大于</strong>下发给浏览器的 <code>timeout</code>——否则用户还在系统弹窗里选认证器，服务端已把它删了，表现为随机的&quot;认证失败&quot;。</p>\n<p>上图的关键点是 <strong>I 这一步必须原子</strong>。典型缺陷是&quot;先查、再验、再删&quot;三步分离：两个并发请求携带同一 challenge 时都能通过查询，产生重放窗口。Redis <code>GETDEL</code>（6.2+）或 Lua 脚本、Postgres <code>DELETE ... RETURNING</code> 都能把校验与消费合并为一次原子操作。若部署是<strong>多实例</strong>，challenge 绝不能放在进程内存或粘性会话里——这是 passkey 上线最高频的翻车点，表现为&quot;换个节点就随机失败&quot;。替代方案是签名型无状态 challenge（把 challenge 连同过期时间、会话标识以 HMAC 签出），但需额外做一次性防重放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"凭证记录-服务端必须落库的字段\">凭证记录：服务端必须落库的字段</h2><p>§4 用一句 MUST 定调：&quot;the Relying Party MUST store some properties of registered public key credential sources&quot;。下表对照 Credential Record 定义，给出字段含义与常见坑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>规范定位</th>\n<th>工程要求与坑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>id</code>（credential ID）</td>\n<td>&quot;At most 1023 bytes long&quot;；生成需 &quot;at least 100 bits of entropy&quot;</td>\n<td><strong>别假设只有几十字节</strong>；§16.6 专设超长 credential ID 测试向量，列宽窄了会截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>publicKey</code></td>\n<td>COSE 编码公钥</td>\n<td>存原始字节；解析见本 hub 的 COSE 凭证模型文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>signCount</code></td>\n<td>最近一次断言的签名计数器</td>\n<td>见下节克隆检测；必须可回写，高并发下防丢失更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transports</code></td>\n<td>注册时 <code>getTransports()</code> 返回值</td>\n<td>规范警告改动它 &quot;could negatively impact user experience, or even prevent use of the corresponding credential&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>uvInitialized</code></td>\n<td>是否曾成功做过用户验证</td>\n<td>为 false 时 &quot;MUST NOT be relied upon as an authentication factor&quot;；false→true 翻转需额外等效因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>backupEligible</code></td>\n<td>创建时 BE 标志</td>\n<td>BE 是凭证属性，对凭据源<strong>永久固定</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>backupState</code></td>\n<td>最近观察到的 BS 标志</td>\n<td>BS <strong>随时间变化</strong>，每次断言回写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rpId</code></td>\n<td>凭据源所属 RP ID</td>\n<td>RECOMMENDED 而非 MUST，但多域站点<strong>必存</strong>——判断&quot;这条凭证能否在本域用&quot;的唯一依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>attestationObject</code></td>\n<td>OPTIONAL</td>\n<td>存下来以便日后重新校验 attestation</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有两点反直觉约束值得强调：<strong><code>backupEligible</code> 与 <code>backupState</code> 是两回事</strong>——前者创建时定死、可用于策略判断（如&quot;要不要对多设备凭证放宽风控&quot;），后者每次登录都可能变、只能当运行时信号；<code>transports</code> 的&quot;只增不减&quot;意味着数据库应存<strong>并集</strong>而非覆盖。此外，跨境站点应额外挂注册时的 <code>topOrigin</code>/<code>crossOrigin</code> 上下文与最近使用的地理/ASN 归属——它们与 <code>signCount</code> 联合才是有效的克隆检测输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rp-id-的作用域规则与多域-rp-id-配置\">RP ID 的作用域规则与多域 RP ID 配置</h2><p>规范 §4 定义 RP ID 为&quot;a valid domain string&quot;，且 <strong>&quot;A public key credential can only be used for authentication with the same entity (as identified by RP ID) it was registered with&quot;</strong>。§5.4.2 进一步约束：RP ID 必须 &quot;is a registrable domain suffix of or is equal to the caller&#39;s origin&#39;s effective domain&quot;，并且 <strong>&quot;does not itself include a scheme or port&quot;</strong>。形式化即：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>valid</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>effDom</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext> effDom</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 以 &quot;.&quot;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext> 结尾</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{valid}(rpId, origin) \\iff \\text{effDom}(origin) = rpId \\ \\lor\\ \\text{effDom}(origin) \\text{ 以 } \\text{&quot;.&quot;} + rpId \\text{ 结尾}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">effDom</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">effDom</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">以</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;.&quot;</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">结尾</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对跨境电商，这直接决定站群架构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>合法 RP ID</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单域 + 子域</td>\n<td><code>example.com</code></td>\n<td>主域下所有子域（<code>www</code>/<code>checkout</code>/<code>m</code>）共享凭证池，推荐默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册在子域</td>\n<td><code>shop.example.com</code></td>\n<td>子域可上溯父域，但注册用哪个之后就只能用哪个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨品牌 / 跨 ccTLD</td>\n<td><code>example.com</code> + ROR</td>\n<td>ccTLD 是<strong>不同注册域</strong>，普通后缀规则不覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方收款域</td>\n<td>各自独立 RP ID</td>\n<td>不同注册域无法共享凭证，只能用 ROR 显式声明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨品牌与多国域名的需求由 <strong>Related Origin Requests (ROR)</strong> 解决，规范 §5.11 定义（来源：<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/webauthn-3/#sctn-related-origins\">https://www.w3.org/TR/webauthn-3/#sctn-related-origins</a>）。RP <strong>MUST 选一个共同 RP ID</strong> 供所有相关来源的仪式使用（&quot;MUST choose a common RP ID to use across all ceremonies from related origins&quot;），并在该 RP ID 下托管 well-known JSON（RFC 8615，见 §12.5）：<code>https://&lt;rpId&gt;/.well-known/webauthn</code>，<strong>MUST 走 HTTPS</strong>，Content-Type <strong>MUST</strong> 为 <code>application/json</code>，顶层对象 <strong>MUST</strong> 含 <code>origins</code> 键，值为一个或多个 web origin 字符串组成的数组。客户端请求该端点 <strong>MUST 不带凭证、不带 referrer</strong>，重定向也 <strong>MUST</strong> 强制 https。上限以**注册域标签（registrable origin label）**计：客户端 &quot;MUST support at least five registrable origin labels&quot;，客户端策略 SHOULD 设上限防滥用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;浏览器: callerOrigin=https://example.co.uk&lt;br/&gt;请求 rpId=example.com&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;rpId 是 callerOrigin 的后缀?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C[&quot;直接通过&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| D[&quot;抓取 https://example.com/.well-known/webauthn&lt;br/&gt;无凭证 / 无 referrer / https&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;200 + application/json&lt;br/&gt;origins 是字符串数组?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F[&quot;抛 SecurityError&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| G[&quot;解析每个 origin 的注册域标签&lt;br/&gt;labelsSeen 计数, maxLabels 上限&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H{&quot;callerOrigin 与某项同源?&quot;}&#10;    H --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C&#10;    H --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| I[&quot;返回 false:使用被拒&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"浏览器: callerOrigin=https://example.co.uk&lt;br/&gt;请求 rpId=example.com\"] --&gt; B{\"rpId 是 callerOrigin 的后缀?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"是\"| C[\"直接通过\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"否\"| D[\"抓取 https://example.com/.well-known/webauthn&lt;br/&gt;无凭证 / 无 referrer / https\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"200 + application/json&lt;br/&gt;origins 是字符串数组?\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"否\"| F[\"抛 SecurityError\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"是\"| G[\"解析每个 origin 的注册域标签&lt;br/&gt;labelsSeen 计数, maxLabels 上限\"]\n    G --&gt; H{\"callerOrigin 与某项同源?\"}\n    H --&gt;|\"是\"| C\n    H --&gt;|\"否\"| I[\"返回 false:使用被拒\"]</pre><p>passkeys.dev 的实现说明（来源：<a href=\"https://passkeys.dev/docs/advanced/related-origins/\">https://passkeys.dev/docs/advanced/related-origins/</a>）补充两条现实约束：其一，<strong>与 RP ID 自身匹配的 origin 不写进 <code>origins</code> 数组</strong>；其二，上限按&quot;标签&quot;而非&quot;条数&quot;计——<code>example.co.uk</code>、<code>example.de</code>、<code>example.sg</code> 共享标签 <code>example</code>，&quot;五个标签&quot;常等价于十几个 ccTLD origin。上线前必须用 <code>PublicKeyCredential.getClientCapabilities()</code> 的 <code>relatedOrigins</code> 字段做特性探测（§5.8.7），不支持的客户端要回落到&quot;先输标识符、再按后端查到的 RP ID 走单域仪式&quot;的降级路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"签名计数器-uv-与状态一致性防护\">签名计数器、UV 与状态一致性防护</h2><p><code>signCount</code> 是服务端唯一能拿到的&quot;凭证可能被复制&quot;信号。§6.1.1 直言其<strong>目的是帮助 RP 检测被克隆的认证器</strong>（&quot;to aid Relying Parties in detecting cloned authenticators&quot;），且 &quot;Clone detection is more important for authenticators with limited protection measures&quot;。不实现计数器的认证器把 <code>signCount</code> <strong>恒定置零</strong>。判定条件因此是&quot;非零且不递增&quot;：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>疑似克隆</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{疑似克隆} \\iff c_{n} \\ne 0 \\ \\land\\ c_{n} \\le c_{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">疑似克隆</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，服务端只存最近一次断言的计数器值。三个必须处理的细节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>零值豁免</strong>。多数平台认证器（含多数同步 passkey 提供方）不上报计数器，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_n = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是常态。把&quot;计数器回退&quot;当硬阻断会挡住正常用户；正确做法是记录、告警、在风控侧加权。</li>\n<li><strong>丢失更新</strong>。两次并发登录都读到旧值 <code>c_{n-1}</code> 并各自写回，后写覆盖前者。用条件更新（<code>UPDATE ... SET sign_count = ? WHERE id = ? AND sign_count = ?</code>）或&quot;只允许递增&quot;约束。</li>\n<li><strong>与 <code>uvInitialized</code> 联动</strong>。用它做&quot;是否免二次验证&quot;决策前必须确认已置 true，且 false→true 翻转需额外等效因子。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>challenge 侧还有一组需同层防护的攻击面：<strong>重放</strong>（一次性消费是根本手段，另可把签名型 challenge 绑定 <code>session_id</code>）、<strong>会话固定</strong>（challenge 必须绑定当前已认证会话，验证成功后轮换会话标识）、<strong>并发竞态</strong>（凭证表对同一 <code>userHandle</code> 的写入要幂等）、<strong>降级拼接</strong>（key 前缀区分仪式类型 <code>reg:</code>/<code>auth:</code>，验证时校验 ceremony 字段）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>把上述规范要求收敛为一份可执行核查表，每行对应一个真实线上故障：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>challenge 服务端生成、≥16 字节（建议 32）、存共享存储、TTL 默认 5 分钟</td>\n<td>§13.4.3 + §15.1</td>\n<td>存进程内存 → 多实例下随机失败；熵不足 → 可被猜测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>challenge 校验与删除原子完成</td>\n<td>§13.4.3&quot;temporarily&quot;</td>\n<td>分步实现 → 重放窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落库 <code>rpId</code>/<code>transports</code>/<code>backupEligible</code>/<code>backupState</code>/<code>uvInitialized</code></td>\n<td>§4</td>\n<td>多域判断与风控失去依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transports</code> 只增不减、credential ID 列宽 ≥1023 字节</td>\n<td>§4 + §16.6</td>\n<td>长 ID 截断 → 用户被永久锁死</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>signCount</code> 非零时才单调校验、条件更新防丢失更新</td>\n<td>§6.1.1</td>\n<td>误报阻断同步 passkey 用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多域用单一 RP ID + ROR well-known 文件，并用 <code>getClientCapabilities().relatedOrigins</code> 探测降级</td>\n<td>§5.11 + §5.8.7</td>\n<td>ccTLD 站群无法共享凭证池；旧客户端直接报错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Google 的 passkey 服务端指引（来源：<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/identity/passkeys/developer-guides/server-introduction\">https://developers.google.com/identity/passkeys/developer-guides/server-introduction</a>）给了同一结论的最小版本：注册时&quot;Store the associated public key on the server&quot;，登录时&quot;Verify the signature on the server&quot;，并建议<strong>使用活跃维护的 FIDO 服务端库</strong>而非对着规范裸写。凭证被吊销、设备注销后的清理出口属于本 hub 的 <a href=\"../passkey-recovery-device-sync/credential-lifecycle-revocation-incident\">凭证生命周期与吊销</a> 文档；<code>signCount</code> 与验签的字节级细节见 <a href=\"../registration-login-flows/ceremony-signature-verification-sigcount\">仪式签名验证与签名计数器</a>；<code>publicKey</code> 的 COSE 结构解析见 <a href=\"../webauthn-crypto-credential-model/public-key-credential-cose-model\">公钥凭证与 COSE 模型</a>。但无论选型还是自研，challenge 生命周期与 RP ID 配置这两块状态，最终都要由你自己的存储层负责到底。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RP 服务端架构与凭证存储（challenge 生命周期与多域 RP ID 配置）","id":"rp-服务端架构与凭证存储-challenge-生命周期与多域-rp-id-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"challenge 的生命周期：生成、临时存储、一次性消费","id":"challenge-的生命周期-生成-临时存储-一次性消费"},{"level":2,"text":"凭证记录：服务端必须落库的字段","id":"凭证记录-服务端必须落库的字段"},{"level":2,"text":"RP ID 的作用域规则与多域 RP ID 配置","id":"rp-id-的作用域规则与多域-rp-id-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"签名计数器、UV 与状态一致性防护","id":"签名计数器-uv-与状态一致性防护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"凭证吊销、设备迁移与丢失设备事件响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/webauthn-passkeys-passwordless-authentication-engineering/passkey-recovery-device-sync/credential-lifecycle-revocation-incident"},"next":{"title":"无密码渐进迁移、注册引导与成功率遥测度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/webauthn-passkeys-passwordless-authentication-engineering/server-integration-compliance-ops/rollout-migration-success-telemetry"}}